    "text": "Center of mass of the chain is at <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>2</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow> <mi>π</mi> </mfrac> </mrow> </math> from horizontal<br /><br />As shown in figure .......<br /><br />Height gain by center of mass is <math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mtext>R</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mi>π</mi> </mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/EM0032472_Ans.jpg\" style=\"width: 223px; height: 99px;\" /><br /><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>Wg</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mtext>g</mtext><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>R</mtext></mrow><mi>π</mi></mfrac></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mtext>W</mtext><mtext>ext.</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mtext>Wg</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>m</mi><mtext>g</mtext><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>R</mtext></mrow><mi>π</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;<strong>Alternate solution</strong><br /><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/32472q.png\" style=\"width: 192px; height: 178px;\" /><br /><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <msub> <mtext>U</mtext> <mtext>i</mtext> </msub><mo>=</mo> <mo>∫</mo> <mo>-</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>dm</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext>gy</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mtext>g</mtext><mo>∫</mo><mtext>R cos</mtext><mi>θ</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>m</mi><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfrac></mfenced><mtext>d</mtext><mi>θ</mi></math><br /><br />&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>Rg</mtext><m